### Authenticate as teacher (Assuming you have a teacher account, otherwise we need to create one or use existing token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get Teacher Groups to find a valid groupId
GET http://localhost:3000/study-groups/teacher/my-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Group Students to find a valid studentId (Pick a valid group ID from previous step, e.g. 1)
@groupId = 1
GET http://localhost:3000/study-groups/{{groupId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
@studentId = 1

### Test 1: Default (Current Month)
GET http://localhost:3000/study-groups/{{groupId}}/students/{{studentId}}/attendance-details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test 2: All Time
GET http://localhost:3000/study-groups/{{groupId}}/students/{{studentId}}/attendance-details?all_time=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test 3: Custom Range
GET http://localhost:3000/study-groups/{{groupId}}/students/{{studentId}}/attendance-details?start_date=2024-01-01&end_date=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
